# vm-state-backup config — one VM per line:  name  ip  parent_dir  subdir
#
# Copy this to `vm-state-backup.conf` (kept LOCAL / gitignored — it holds your
# real LAN IPs) and edit the addresses. The example IPs below use RFC 5737
# TEST-NET ranges; replace them with your VMs' actual addresses.
#
# name             ip            parent_dir      subdir
musicassistant     192.0.2.13    /opt/mass       data
nodered            192.0.2.14    /opt/nodered    data
scrypted           192.0.2.15    /opt/scrypted   volume
